{"unit_id":"YuMu247__dsh-kb-rag#feature-1","repo":"YuMu247/dsh-kb-rag","commit":"1ca2896cd05842df62a6c640589107696b01639f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-kb-rag 的功能「本地语义检索」：通过 kb_query 按问题或关键词查询本机 ChromaDB 向量库，返回带来源、块编号和相似度的片段；可设置返回数量，范围为 1 到 20。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:82-89"]}
{"unit_id":"YuMu247__dsh-kb-rag#feature-2","repo":"YuMu247/dsh-kb-rag","commit":"1ca2896cd05842df62a6c640589107696b01639f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-kb-rag 的功能「文档目录入库」：通过 kb_ingest 将文档目录切块并交给 kb-rag 入库，可指定块大小、重叠量、按标题切分、强制重建或先重置向量库。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:150-172"]}
{"unit_id":"YuMu247__dsh-kb-rag#feature-3","repo":"YuMu247/dsh-kb-rag","commit":"1ca2896cd05842df62a6c640589107696b01639f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-kb-rag 的功能「网页批量抓取」：通过 kb_crawl 提供 URL 列表或 URL 文件，将网页抓取输出为 Markdown；可以指定输出目录和请求间隔。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:215-237"]}
{"unit_id":"YuMu247__dsh-kb-rag#feature-4","repo":"YuMu247/dsh-kb-rag","commit":"1ca2896cd05842df62a6c640589107696b01639f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-kb-rag 的功能「关联资料推荐」：通过 kb_related 以主题关键词或已知文档名为起点查找关联资料，并可选择图谱式知识漫游。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:291-338"]}
